opencode-voice-phonon
==============

This package contains the opencode-voice-phonon plugin code (MIT) and vendors the
following third-party components.

1. phonon-2.5-c inference engine
--------------------------------
Source: https://github.com/eschmidbauer/phonon-2.5-c
License: MIT (see native/vendor/phonon25/LICENSE)

Copyright (c) 2026 the phonon-2.5-c authors.

The Windows compatibility layer under native/vendor/phonon25/win32 is part of
opencode-voice-phonon and is licensed MIT with the rest of this package.

2. Phonon-2.5 model weights
---------------------------
Source: https://huggingface.co/FermionResearch/Phonon-2.5
Repacked for the C engine by eschmidbauer:
https://huggingface.co/eschmidbauer/phonon-2.5-c
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)

Phonon-2.5 is by Fermion Research, derived from NVIDIA's
parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3. The weights are downloaded by the user at first run and
are not included in this package. The full attribution and list of changes are
in the NOTICE file of the weights repository:
https://huggingface.co/FermionResearch/Phonon-2.5/blob/main/NOTICE

3. NVIDIA parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
------------------------------
Source: https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
License: CC-BY-4.0

The Phonon-2.5 weights are a derivative of this model. See the Phonon-2.5
NOTICE for the complete training-data and attribution terms.

4. OpenCode plugin SDK and OpenTUI
----------------------------------
@opencode/plugin, @opencode/client, @opentui/core, @opentui/solid and
solid-js are used under their respective licenses. They are dependencies, not
vendored source.
